   "text": "A malformed answer, a timeout\nor a Gemini error → the order\nis held for review. After a\ncall: no summary, nothing\nelse changes.",
   "originalText": "A malformed answer, a timeout\nor a Gemini error → the order\nis held for review. After a\ncall: no summary, nothing\nelse changes.",
   "fontSize": 16,
