   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Out — AssessmentResult\n• status: completed · skipped · disabled · no_evidence · quota_exhausted\n• reasons: at most 3, each {text, signal_keys}; source: agents or rules\n• after a call: summary (English) → the call and the review queue\n\nNot an action and not a suggestion: score, tier and action\ncome from code (agentic-new-order.png).",
   "originalText": "Out — AssessmentResult\n• status: completed · skipped · disabled · no_evidence · quota_exhausted\n• reasons: at most 3, each {text, signal_keys}; source: agents or rules\n• after a call: summary (English) → the call and the review queue\n\nNot an action and not a suggestion: score, tier and action\ncome from code (agentic-new-order.png).",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
